---
import GreenHeading from "../../components/GreenHeading.astro";
import BaseLayoutAstroComponent from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import aboutUsImage from "../../assets/o-nama.jpg";
import DescriptionList from "../../components/DescriptionList.astro";
import DescriptionItem from "../../components/DescriptionItem.astro";
import "../../styles/about-us.css";
---

<BaseLayoutAstroComponent>
	<GreenHeading
		>🌿 Together we protect nature. Together we build a responsible community.
	</GreenHeading>
	<main>
		<div class="image-container">
			<Image src={aboutUsImage} alt="Друштво под дудом - о нама" />
		</div>

		<p class="about-us-description">
			The association „Društvo pod dudom“ Morović is a non-governmental, non-profit organization
			founded in 2024 with the aim of protecting and improving the environment, developing the rural
			community and encouraging active citizen participation in nature conservation. Through
			volunteer actions, educational programs and outdoor events, we work on concrete changes in our
			community. We believe that responsibility toward the environment begins in one’s own yard,
			street and village.
		</p>
		<section class="foundations" id="foundations">
			<h3>The foundations of our work are:</h3>
			<div class="description-list-container">
				<DescriptionList
					items={["VOLUNTEERISM", "TRANSPARENCY", "SOLIDARITY", "ACTIVISM"]}
					desktopColumnSize={4}
				/>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="goals" id="goals">
			<h3>Our goals are:</h3>
			<ul>
				<li>🌱 Improving environmental protection</li>
				<li>🌱 Educating children and youth</li>
				<li>🌱 Organizing volunteer actions</li>
				<li>🌱 Encouraging healthy lifestyle habits</li>
				<li>🌱 Developing rural tourism</li>
				<li>🌱 Supporting humanitarian activities</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="highlight">
				We place special emphasis on practical activities – cleaning natural areas, afforestation,
				ecological workshops, outdoor sporting events and public events that encourage responsible
				behavior toward natural resources.
			</p>
		</section>
		<section class="legal-description">
			<h3>
				The association „Društvo pod dudom“ Morović is organized as a non-governmental, non-profit
				association based on the principles of democratic decision-making, transparency and active
				member participation.
			</h3>
			<p class="members">The bodies of the Association are:</p>
			<div class="government">
				<div>
					<DescriptionItem>ASSEMBLY</DescriptionItem>
					<div class="desc-container">
						<p>
							<i>
								The Assembly consists of all members of the Association and is the highest
								decision-making body.
							</i>
						</p>
						<p>
							<i>
								The Assembly adopts the Statute and other general acts, approves the work plan and
								program, reviews and adopts reports on operations and financial management, decides
								on the election and dismissal of members of the Association’s bodies, as well as on
								status matters and the further development of the organization.
							</i>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<DescriptionItem>MANAGING BOARD</DescriptionItem>
					<div class="desc-container">
						<p>
							<i>
								The Managing Board is the executive body that directs the work of the Association
								between two Assembly sessions.
							</i>
						</p>
						<p>
							<i>
								It organizes activities, implements the decisions of the Assembly, makes operational
								and financial decisions and ensures the realization of the Association’s goals.
							</i>
						</p>
						<p>
							<i>
								The President of the Managing Board represents the Association in legal matters and
								is responsible for the legality of its work, while the Vice-President acts in his
								absence.
							</i>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div>
					<DescriptionItem>SUPERVISORY BOARD</DescriptionItem>
					<div class="desc-container">
						<p>
							<i>
								The Supervisory Board controls financial operations and oversees the legality of the
								Association’s work.
							</i>
						</p>
						<p>
							<i>
								It informs the Managing Board and the Assembly of any observed irregularities,
								thereby providing an additional level of accountability and transparency.
							</i>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<p class="disclaimer">
			The work of the Association is public. Members and the interested public are regularly
			informed about activities, decisions and financial reports. This ensures trust, accountability
			and the long-term sustainability of the organization.
		</p>
	</main>
</BaseLayoutAstroComponent>
